<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orckit started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orckit started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it started coverage of Orckit Communications Ltd with a strong buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/8 to 16-5/8.</p>
</text>
